{# A post's permalink: under its community's slug when it is in one, and its
   author's name otherwise — see `post_page_path` in src/models/post.rs, which
   is where that is decided and which every other handle redirects to.

   The row shapes differ in what they call the author, so any of the three
   names will do; `community_slug` is the same everywhere. #}
{% macro post_url(post, post_id="") %}
{%- set handle = post.community_slug or post.login_name or post.user_login_name or post.author_login_name -%}
/@{{ handle }}/{{ post_id or post.id }}
{%- endmacro %}
